\nThe candidates have titles combining a topic (事务传播/transaction propagation, 缓存失效/cache invalidation, 任务取消/task cancellation, 线程池排队/thread pool queueing, 连接池等待/connection pool waiting, 接口幂等/API idempotency, 并发更新/concurrent update, 慢查询/slow query, 组合索引/composite index, 消息重复/message duplication) with a content type (概念速览/concept overview, 条件与原理/conditions and principles, 操作记录/operation records, 专题观察/topic observation, 市场观察/market observation).\n\nThe \"市场观察\" (market observation) type explicitly covers 培训招生价格、证书推广和薪资排名 (training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings) — which the user explicitly does NOT want. So I should exclude all \"市场观察\" candidates.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" (topic observation) type covers 技术社区活动、软件发展沿革与开发者访谈 (tech community activities, software development history, developer interviews) — this is more about industry culture/community, not directly about database/concurrency/fault handling implementation. These are less relevant to the user's focus on implementation and principles.\n\nThe most relevant content types for the user's interest (implementation and principles of databases, concurrency, fault handling) are:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - explains state changes, concurrency ordering, resource boundaries, conditions for solutions\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - minimal reproduction scenarios, key logs, locating waits and data changes, verification steps\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - lists common concepts, provides problem catalog\n\nLet me identify the candidates that are NOT market observation and NOT topic observation (which are less relevant). Actually, let me reconsider. The user wants implementation and principles. The best matches are 条件与原理 and 操作记录. 概念速览 is a concept overview which is also relevant as an entry point.\n\nLet me count the relevant candidates. I need to select 20.\n\nLet me categorize all candidates by their content type suffix:\n\nMarket observation (市场观察) - EXCLUDE (training/cert/salary content):\n- i